>> [    0.829539] fec 30be0000.ethernet: IRQ int2 not found
>>
>> Signed-off-by: Anson Huang <Anson.Huang@nxp.com>
>> Acked-by: Fugang Duan <fugang.duan@nxp.com>
>> Reviewed-by: Stephen Boyd <swboyd@chromium.org>
